Package: grfics-router
Version: 1.3
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Fortiphyd Logic <info@fortiphyd.com>
Description: GRFICSv3 OT lab router and firewall
 Flask-based router/firewall UI with Suricata IDS, dnsmasq DNS,
 WireGuard VPN, and ARP monitoring for the GRFICSv3 OT/ICS security lab.
Depends: python3, python3-flask, iptables, iproute2, suricata,
 dnsmasq, ulogd2, ulogd2-json, wireguard-tools, tcpdump,
 curl, procps, iputils-ping
